		{
			title: "Computer Upgrades"
			x: 2.75d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&7Your normal SBURB Computer is great and all, but you're already in The Medium. So why not upgrade it a bit? "
				""
				"&7You can break the SBURB Computer and Captchalogue it. Nothing will break, you only lose the special Server Edit mode until you put out another Computer and insert the Client and Server discs, and resume your connection."
				""
				"&7The first Computer upgrade you can do is getting yourself a Laptop instead! It looks nicer and is more portable. Kinda. "
			]
			dependencies: ["4EAEC7D5C5DD1893"]
			id: "6F2679D258D56AD2"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1F42AE925654F800"
