			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "5F971CECCFFE5BEB"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "The Grist of the Matter"
			x: 10.25d
			y: 1.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&7If you're having trouble finding certain types of Grist, or have an abundance of items you aren't sending to us at The Ferret Business, you could always convert it back into Grist (as long as you can MAKE it with Grist, that is)."
				""
				"&7To do that, you'll need two things : Boondollars (which can be obtained from Dungeons and hidden treasures, which you can find arond The Medium), and the GristWidget 12000."
				""
				"&7The GristWidget 12000 is a machine you can place down, and insert Captchalogued (not Punched!) items into, and then spend Boondollars to convert them into Grist."
			]
			dependencies: ["1CFC5516EB224C18"]
			id: "55A4B37D7392342A"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1B94CAF87A772205"
				type: "item"
				item: "minestuck:grist_widget"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "4540056C6470E594"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Nuclear Cooking"
			x: 1.5d
			y: 1.25d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&7Want to put that Raw Uranium to use? Why not make a Cookalyzer?"
				""
				"&7The Cookalyzer is an odd Minestuck Machine that is sort of like an upgraded Furnace... but not at the same time? But instead of Coal or Wood as it's fuel, it uses... Raw Uranium."
				""
				"&7Unlike a Furnace, it stores the fuel and only uses it when processing an item. One Raw Uranium can smelt HALF A STACK worth of items!"
				""
				"&7The downside, though? It can only smelt some items. Not Ores it seems, but making Charcoal, cooking food, etc is super fast. You have to click GO to smelt an item... for every item. That's another downside."
				""
				"&7Also, apparently due to the radiation of cooking, some items may not... turn out the same as they would in a Furnace. Just a warning!"
			]
			dependencies: ["0029F0BC75976423"]
			id: "4F927767F75DB147"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4018EF74C0948014"
				type: "item"
				item: "minestuck:uranium_cooker"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "3187298F7FD11672"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "An Idea Too Good..."
			x: 5.25d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&7I've heard tales from when SBURB was online that you could make Golden Seeds that grew Gold."
				""
				"&7I mean, that's nothing really new to us. The last world you were trapped in, you had such seeds. Not here though..."
				""
				"&7Though I'd take all this with a grain of salt. It feels like... a bit of a troll."
			]
			dependencies: ["4EAEC7D5C5DD1893"]
