			description: [
				"&7SBURB had a lot of interesting, tasty, and weird foods. And in Minestuck most of them are still around, though they may be different now..."
				""
				"&7The most popular items were the variety of Cakes you could cook, Alchemize, or find (in fact, an entire Medium type is Cake, with Cake everywhere!)"
				""
