		{
			title: "Consorts and Currency"
			x: 6.5d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&7The Medium is home to much more than just Imps, Golems, and more dangerous creatures. Consorts, which you probably found a few on your island after it was teleported, are friendly denizens of this strange place."
				""
				"&7The primary form of currency amongst the various Consort races is called the Boondollar. You start with some the moment you enter The Medium, and can find more by finding dungeons in the Medium, and various scattered treasure chests as well."
				""
				"&7You can find Consort Villages scattered around The Medium. Many have special Consort Shops you can spend your Boondollars at!"
			]
			dependencies: ["0029F0BC75976423"]
			id: "1B641C0638CBBA3C"
