			description: [
				"&7Axekind is a weapon type one could specialize in with the original SBURB game, but in Minestuck its just a classification of weapon."
				""
				"&7Axekind weapons in Minestuck act like regular axes, being good for cutting down wood and similar materials."
				""
				"&7The Coppice Crusher, though, can fell entire trees (if said trees are 20 blocks or less large!). If there is too much for it to cut down, it will do a 3x3 area instead."
				""
