		{
			title: "Wandering in Dungeons"
			x: 4.0d
			y: -2.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&7Exploring away from your Land and base, you'll come across a few different things."
				""
				"&7The first is a LOT more than just the two types of Imps you have on your Base land. They are rarer, but other types of Imps can spawn, as well as bigger, more dangerous creatures such as Liches and Salamanders!"
				""
				"&7You'll also find Consort villages. You can find Trader Consorts, who can carry a whole slew of uncommon and rare items you cannot Alchemically combine things to get. Keep an eye out!"
				""
				"&7Another important thing you can find are Dungeons. These are staircases that lead to a big drop into the Dungeon. Be careful, Imps and other creatures spawn in these winding corridoors! Yet many rare Minestuck items can be found down here too."
				""
				"&7Like these... questionably named candies."
			]
			dependencies: ["0029F0BC75976423"]
			id: "5D1BFAD59386BF52"
			tasks: [
