			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Daunting Text of Magical Frivolity"
			x: 6.5d
			y: -2.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&7Colonel Sassacre is a fabled... well, something from the SBURB days. I'm not sure if he was an NPC or a dev or just a guest writer or something. "
				""
				"&7One of the things he wrote, though, was Colonel Sassacre's Daunting Text of Magical Frivolity and Practical Japery, a very long titled book full of jokes and pranks."
				""
				"&7Though I don't think you can read it in this version of Minestuck... There must be another use for it, yes?"
