		{
			title: "A Shake of the Chance Cube"
			x: 6.5d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&7What a strange thing to find in a dungeon. Thats just... a large D6? "
				""
				"&7Well, it looks like the original Alchemy recipe from SBURB is still in. You can Alchemy combine that with a Bucket to get yourself an 8-Ball. Another fun but not exactly useful item. At least... for the moment, of course. We are, after all, in the Minestuck game here."
				""
				"&7Keep in mind, you need to PUNCH the Bucket Captchalogue card, but not the Dice card. Then you leave the (Punched) Bucket card in the Designix and punch it with the Unpunched Dice card."
				""
				"&7Unfortunately, this Minestuck version of SBURB doesn't have the Alchemization for the actual 8-ball...but we can still use the punched 8-ball card in other recipes."
				""
				"&7Maybe you can find one in a Dungeon? Not that it's terribly useful."
			]
			dependencies: ["5D1BFAD59386BF52"]
