			y: 3.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&7The Pogo Hammer is the next step in Hammerkind weaponry, quite a useful thing. If you Right Click it on a block, you'll bounce up into the air! You can time this right and prevent fall damage... if, you know, you forgot you could Double Lump for some reason."
