				"&7Oh, also, if you hit enemies with the Pogo Hammer, it knocks them back further as well. Cause, you know, they aren't a solid block."
				""
				"&7The Wrinklefucker is one of the upgrades to the Pogo Hammer, combining a couple Clothes Irons to it with Alchemy. Great for ironing out shirts, bouncing around like the Pogo Hammer, and crushing enemies."
